        : name == "sun" || name == "clear" ? "M16 12a4 4 0 1 1-8 0a4 4 0 1 1 8 0z M12 2v2 M12 20v2 M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4 M17.7 17.7l1.4 1.4 M2 12h2 M20 12h2 M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4 M17.7 6.3l1.4-1.4"
        : name == "back-arrow" ? "M15 5l-7 7 7 7"
