        : name == "eye-off" ? "M3 3l18 18 M10.6 5.1A10 10 0 0 1 12 5c6.5 0 10 7 10 7a17 17 0 0 1-3 3.9 M6.6 6.6A17 17 0 0 0 2 12s3.5 7 10 7a9.7 9.7 0 0 0 5.4-1.6 M9.9 9.9a3 3 0 0 0 4.2 4.2"
